From: guille-vega <guillermo.vega@balena.io>
Subject: DEBUG: Trace the boot from the SPL to the console of U-Boot proper

Temporary, do not merge. U-Boot proper of the iot-gate-imx8plus does not print
anything after BL31 and the board restarts. Find how far it gets:

- the SPL prints what it hands to BL31: the entry points, the FDT and the
  first words found at the entry point of U-Boot and at the FDT
- the SPL prints the reset cause of the previous boot (SRC_SRSR) as soon as it
  has a console, and clears it, so each boot shows its own
- U-Boot proper writes a marker to UART2 between the steps of
  init_sequence_f, as the console is not available until serial_init() and
  console_init_f(), and when the sequence fails. UART2 is left set up by the SPL

---

diff --git a/board/compulab/plat/imx8mp/spl/spl.c b/board/compulab/plat/imx8mp/spl/spl.c
--- a/board/compulab/plat/imx8mp/spl/spl.c
