+		 * DEBUG ONLY, remove after the investigation: why the board
+		 * restarted, 0x1 power on, 0x8 IPP USER, 0x10 WDOG, 0x40 JTAG
+		 * SW, 0x80 WDOG3, 0x100 WDOG2. Clear it so that the next boot
